 ### Problem Title
 #### Problem 584. Find Customer Referee.
---------------------------------------------------------------  || Problem Description ||  -------------------------------------------------------------------------

Problem Description
Table: Customer

+-------------+---------+
| Column Name | Type    |
+-------------+---------+
| id          | int     |
| name        | varchar |
| referee_id  | int     |
+-------------+---------+
In SQL, id is the primary key column for this table.
Each row of this table indicates the id of a customer, their name, and the id of the customer who referred them.
 

Find the names of the customer that are either:

referred by any customer with id != 2.
not referred by any customer.
Return the result table in any order.

The result format is in the following example.

Example 1:

Input: 
Customer table:
+----+------+------------+
| id | name | referee_id |
+----+------+------------+
| 1  | Will | null       |
| 2  | Jane | null       |
| 3  | Alex | 2          |
| 4  | Bill | null       |
| 5  | Zack | 1          |
| 6  | Mark | 2          |
+----+------+------------+
Output: 
+------+
| name |
+------+
| Will |
| Jane |
| Bill |
| Zack |
+------+
---------------------------------------------------------------  ||  My Approach  ||  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

My Approach
I first identified that the condition excludes customers with referee_id = 2.
Customers with referee_id IS NULL must also be included since they were not referred by anyone.
Combining these two conditions with an OR operator gives the correct result.
The challenge was ensuring null values are handled properly, since NULL != 2 does not evaluate to true in SQL. That’s why IS NULL must be explicitly checked.
---------------------------------------------------------------  || Solution Query ||  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Solution Query
sql
-- Clean, formatted SQL query
SELECT name
FROM Customer
WHERE referee_id IS NULL OR referee_id != 2;

